AWPTCM-T9555 (1.0) — MAC/Phy TLV: port speed 1000 duplex=half
tb470 IE520 stack · port2.0.1 · 2026-09-03 · RESULT: testCaseExcl (not producible on this platform)

The device refuses 1000 Mbit half-duplex:
  awplus(config-if)# speed 1000
  awplus(config-if)# duplex half
  % Cannot set speed 1000 and half duplex port2.0.1
Correct product behaviour — 1000BASE-T is full-duplex only (IEEE 802.3ab); a 1000BaseTHD MAU
is not implemented. Confirmed at the port-hardware level: NO IE520 front port accepts half-duplex
(empty-port probe -> "% Duplex set failed"). See port-capability-matrix.txt.
Disposition: testCaseExcl — half-duplex unsupported on this platform. Not a defect.
